  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment preparation study for setting up a local Kipster stable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kipster is considering an investment in a Kipster barn to produce sustainable eggs in South Africa. The Kipster concept is currently already successful in the Netherlands. In Africa, the emphasis is currently still on producing as much food as possible, with sustainability aspects not having a high priority.Kipster is convinced that economically efficient production of cheap food is at the expense of the environment, the climate, nature and animals. Kipster&apos;s goal is to help Africa to produce an egg that does not harm the environment, climate, nature and animals. Therefore they want to invest in an own Kipster barn to produce its own sustainable eggs in Africa. On the longer run, the concept should be scaled up.</narrative>
  </description>
